いるもの（でもセックスで気持ちよくなってはいる）が理想的です。月は目の前にいるのが魅上だと気づいてない様子でお願いします。\n\nその他依頼文に書かれていないことはダミィさんにお任せいたします。描きやすいようにご自由に改変しても大丈夫です。\nもし何か問題があれば遠慮なくキャンセル、もしくは再送依頼を送っていただいて構いません。よろしくお願い致します！", "nc": 57, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 69850, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "鼠畜生(そちくしょう)", "screen_name": "Hagfish21", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1614588944922050561/U8rjlCF_.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/4445243543/1665336321/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 161}, {"id": 425165, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": false, "name": "🔞性竜🐲", "screen_name": "sayryu0721", "avatar_url": "https://proxy.misskeyusercontent.jp/avatar.webp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.misskeyusercontent.jp%2Fio%2F4bac8553-a593-4742-9f3c-52836cea6fe2.webp&avatar=1", "header_url": "https://media.misskeyusercontent.jp/io/2ac5dfed-e3a3-46fb-9957-efae34984dd6.webp?sensitive=true", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "comic"}], "nc": 160}, {"id": 807475, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "かにたそ🔞@Skeb開けてます！", "screen_name": "_kanitaso_", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1803567327377760257/TAZZqcMG.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/824613010421395457/1673790516/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at